{"id": "doc-01-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "11 joueurs maximum par équipe sur le terrain, gardien compris.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 112, "tokens_out": 16, "latency_s": 10.615817617000033, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-01-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "11 joueurs au maximum, gardien compris.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 129, "tokens_out": 12, "latency_s": 2.177875702999984, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-02-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "En football, un match ne peut pas continuer si une équipe compte moins de **7 joueurs**. Il s’arrête donc dès qu’une équipe passe à **6 joueurs ou moins**.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 116, "tokens_out": 41, "latency_s": 1.737679170999968, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-02-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "En football, un match ne peut pas continuer si une équipe compte moins de **7 joueurs** sur le terrain.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 132, "tokens_out": 26, "latency_s": 1.514901956000017, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-03-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "En général, **5 remplacements maximum**, en **3 fenêtres de changement** (la mi-temps ne compte pas). Les règles peuvent varier selon la compétition.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 115, "tokens_out": 36, "latency_s": 2.386052800000016, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-03-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "En règle générale, il peut effectuer **5 remplacements**, en trois fenêtres de jeu au maximum (hors mi-temps). Les règles peuvent varier selon la compétition : de quel championnat s’agit-il ?", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 126, "tokens_out": 43, "latency_s": 2.7109375340000383, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-04-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Pour un ballon de football réglementaire (taille 5), la circonférence doit être de **68 à 70 cm**.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 110, "tokens_out": 31, "latency_s": 1.9326594489999707, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-04-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Pour un ballon de football à 11, la circonférence doit être comprise entre **68 et 70 cm** (règle 2 de l’IFAB).", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 126, "tokens_out": 39, "latency_s": 1.7484879290000208, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-05-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Au coup d’envoi, le ballon doit peser entre **410 et 450 g** (règle 2 de l’IFAB).", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 115, "tokens_out": 34, "latency_s": 2.1018332379999833, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-05-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Le ballon doit peser entre **410 et 450 grammes** au début du match.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 121, "tokens_out": 22, "latency_s": 1.4547346319999974, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-06-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Pour un terrain de football, la ligne de touche mesure **au minimum 90 m et au maximum 120 m**. Pour les matchs internationaux : **100 à 110 m**.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 110, "tokens_out": 41, "latency_s": 2.2915508710000267, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-06-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Pour un terrain de football à 11, les lignes de touche doivent mesurer **au minimum 90 m et au maximum 120 m**. Pour les matchs internationaux, la plage est de **100 à 110 m**.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 123, "tokens_out": 49, "latency_s": 2.3281396170000335, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-07-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "La surface de réparation commence à **16,5 m de chaque poteau**, mesurés vers l’intérieur du terrain.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 114, "tokens_out": 28, "latency_s": 1.8060746709999762, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-07-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Place les lignes à **16,5 m de chaque poteau**, mesurés le long de la ligne de but. Elles s’étendent ensuite de **16,5 m dans le terrain**, perpendiculairement à la ligne de but.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 128, "tokens_out": 53, "latency_s": 2.3799050110000053, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-08-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Un match de football se joue en deux mi-temps de 45 minutes, avec du temps additionnel à la fin de chacune.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 109, "tokens_out": 30, "latency_s": 3.2023082029999728, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-08-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Chaque période dure 45 minutes, hors temps additionnel.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 125, "tokens_out": 15, "latency_s": 2.3599775879999925, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-09-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Au football, la pause de mi-temps dure **15 minutes maximum**.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 113, "tokens_out": 19, "latency_s": 2.431202073999998, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-09-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Selon les Lois du jeu, la mi-temps ne doit pas dépasser 15 minutes. Les joueurs peuvent rester au vestiaire pendant cette pause, mais le règlement de la compétition peut prévoir une durée différente.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 124, "tokens_out": 49, "latency_s": 2.900159615000007, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-10-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "L’arbitre accorde un corner à l’équipe adverse. Depuis 2025, la limite est de **8 secondes** : il peut faire un compte visuel des 5 dernières secondes.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 122, "tokens_out": 43, "latency_s": 2.1705243669999845, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-10-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "L’arbitre accorde un corner à l’équipe adverse. Selon les Lois du Jeu, le gardien ne peut garder le ballon en main que huit secondes.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 131, "tokens_out": 36, "latency_s": 2.2176499889999945, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-11-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Les adversaires doivent se tenir à **au moins 9,15 m (10 yards)** du ballon, jusqu’à ce qu’il soit en jeu.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 116, "tokens_out": 34, "latency_s": 2.0928321930000493, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-11-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "À au moins **9,15 m (10 yards)** du ballon, jusqu’à ce qu’il soit en jeu. Si tu es sur ta ligne de but, tu peux rester entre les poteaux.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 126, "tokens_out": 44, "latency_s": 2.123937015000024, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-12-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Le but est refusé : sur une touche, on ne peut pas marquer directement dans le but adverse. L’équipe adverse reprend par un coup de pied de but.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 117, "tokens_out": 37, "latency_s": 2.159899080999992, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-12-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "But refusé : le jeu reprend par un coup de pied de but pour l’équipe adverse.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 132, "tokens_out": 22, "latency_s": 1.9246084929999938, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-13-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Non. Il n’y a pas de hors-jeu directement sur une touche.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 110, "tokens_out": 19, "latency_s": 1.519062692000034, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-13-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Non. Un joueur ne peut pas être hors-jeu s’il reçoit directement le ballon d’une rentrée de touche, même s’il est derrière tous les défenseurs.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 136, "tokens_out": 36, "latency_s": 1.482003034999991, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-14-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "On juge le hors-jeu avec toute partie du corps pouvant jouer le ballon, sauf les bras et les mains. Pour un gardien, les bras comptent aussi comme des mains.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 113, "tokens_out": 40, "latency_s": 1.5308002990000205, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-14-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Le bras ne compte pas : les mains et les bras ne peuvent pas rendre un joueur hors-jeu. Seules les parties du corps avec lesquelles il peut légalement jouer le ballon — tête, tronc et jambes — sont prises en compte.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 134, "tokens_out": 52, "latency_s": 2.1768089390000114, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-15-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "S’il tarde volontairement à tirer un coup de pied de but, l’arbitre peut le sanctionner pour perte de temps : avertissement (carton jaune) et coup franc indirect pour l’équipe adverse si le retard est jugé excessif.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 118, "tokens_out": 54, "latency_s": 2.2601525850000144, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-15-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "L’arbitre peut sanctionner le gardien pour retard de reprise du jeu : avertissement (carton jaune) et coup franc indirect contre son équipe. Il peut aussi ajouter le temps perdu au temps additionnel.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 132, "tokens_out": 47, "latency_s": 3.0316441740000073, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-16-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Le gardien doit rester sur sa ligne de but, entre les poteaux, face au tireur. Au moment de la frappe, il doit avoir au moins une partie d’un pied sur la ligne, au-dessus ou derrière celle-ci.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 112, "tokens_out": 51, "latency_s": 2.1415845820000072, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-16-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Place-toi au centre du but, sur ta ligne, face au ballon. Reste derrière la ligne jusqu’au tir, avec au moins un pied qui la touche, la recouvre ou se trouve au-dessus. Ajuste ensuite ta position selon les indices du tireur, sans anticiper trop tôt.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 122, "tokens_out": 64, "latency_s": 2.094178440999997, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-17-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Chaque équipe tire **5 fois**, en alternant les tirs. Si l’égalité persiste, on passe à la mort subite.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 115, "tokens_out": 31, "latency_s": 1.9808516740000073, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-17-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Chaque équipe tire cinq fois lors de la première série. Si l’égalité persiste, les tirs continuent en mort subite, à raison d’un tir par équipe à chaque tour.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 132, "tokens_out": 41, "latency_s": 1.9741605719999598, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-18-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "La VAR peut intervenir sur quatre types de décisions :\n\n- **But ou non-but** : hors-jeu, faute, ballon sorti, etc.\n- **Penalty ou non-penalty**.\n- **Carton rouge direct** (pas un second avertissement).\n- **Erreur d’identité** : mauvais joueur sanctionné.\n\nL’arbitre peut aussi revoir une décision de carton rouge direct après un incident grave manqué.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 112, "tokens_out": 88, "latency_s": 2.2676330890000145, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-18-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Les images peuvent être utilisées pour revoir quatre types de décisions :\n\n- valider ou refuser un but ;\n- accorder ou non un penalty ;\n- attribuer un carton rouge direct ;\n- corriger une erreur d’identité lorsqu’un joueur est sanctionné à la place d’un autre.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 127, "tokens_out": 60, "latency_s": 2.0184432140000013, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-19-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Ken Aston, arbitre anglais, a imaginé les cartons jaune et rouge après la Coupe du monde 1966. Ils ont été utilisés pour la première fois lors du Mondial 1970.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 114, "tokens_out": 43, "latency_s": 1.752176415000008, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-19-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 0, "answer": "Ken Aston, arbitre anglais, est à l’origine de l’idée des cartons jaunes et rouges. Il l’a proposée après la Coupe du monde 1966, pour rendre les avertissements et expulsions plus clairs pour les joueurs et le public.", "sources": [], "retrieved": [], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 126, "tokens_out": 54, "latency_s": 1.7767901349999988, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": null, "mrr": null, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
